"Feedback Submission" means a distinct feedback record successfully created
and persisted by the Licensed Work. An idempotent request replay that returns
an existing record is not a new Feedback Submission. A record still counts if
it is later updated, closed, archived, or deleted. "Aggregate Monthly Feedback
Submissions" means the total Feedback Submissions created during a calendar
month across you, your company, all workspaces, and all production deployments
of the Licensed Work.

